# Known high and critical vulnerabilities in the third-party images of docker-compose.yml that
# this repository cannot fix itself (SCF-AC-5.3). Every entry needs a reason and expires at the
# end of Sprint 2; after that the container scan fails again until the image is replaced or the
# entry is renewed with a new reason. Replacing the images is SCF-US-2 slice 2 (#103).
# Found with Trivy 0.69.3 on 2026-10-13, unfixed vulnerabilities are not reported (--ignore-unfixed).

# gosu in postgres:18 and mongo:8.0 is built with an old Go standard library (and golang.org/x/net);
# gosu only drops root privileges at container start and opens no network connection.
# Upstream must rebuild it.
